  "body": "As per, https://github.com/w3c/browser-payment-api/issues/322 and also in HTML, it seems that spec editors want to talk about \"characters\", as those things <del>logically</del> editorially make most sense. \r\n\r\nIt would be nice if WebIDL allowed talking about \"characters\" in the context of DOMString.",
